Subject: [PATCH] protected-wins: register the v0.1.3.1 opt-in arms
 (KV_ZERO_FREED entry, GATHER_EXT joins the slot-major gather)

protected-win validate refused two point-release commits as unregistered. New entry
kv-zero-freed-cells-opt-in for lane 300 1ea866f868 7ecb9a918b 2fc868a681 (opt-in correctness fix:
-fa off history == fresh when on; default off = merge base), from lane 300 trailers and receipts.
Lane 302 bfa4b73e2d 5991bb1e34 (GGML_ARIFI_MOE_GATHER_EXT, opt-in, measured slower) join
vulkan-moe-gather-slot-major-matvec-id as a NOT-a-win arm, the aa9cac23ae precedent.

Origin: lane-298
Measured-effect: none (protected-win ledger registration; the numbers live in the entries)
